<title>USA: Lawrence Metro SD, Ind., won by City Securities.</title>
<headline>Lawrence Metro SD, Ind., won by City Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>City Securities Corp said it won $7.500 million of Lawrence Township Metropolitan School District, Ind., general obligation bonds of 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.98 percent.</p>
</text>
